    "turn_text": "Likewise, great meeting you too. You're back on tour now. As your website says, you're the only former US Senator currently on tour. I have seen clips of your set and I have always been surprised at your ability to maintain a sense of humor even as our democracy is hurtling towards a cliff. How do you do it?",
